    "sections": {
        "description": "The Wellness Center theme is designed for businesses offering spa services, massage therapy, relaxation programs, and body treatment solutions. It includes organized layouts for service listings, therapist profiles, testimonials, appointment sections, and contact information. The responsive design helps content display smoothly across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options allow adjustments to colors, typography, banners, and page layouts while maintaining a clean and calming appearance. The theme also supports image galleries, blog sections, and call-to-action areas for presenting wellness programs and therapy services clearly. Suitable for a beauty spa, spa salon, hydrotherapy center, skin care clinic, or wellness center, the layout provides a structured framework for showcasing treatments, therapy sessions, relaxation services, and professional care offerings in an accessible and professional format."
    },
